# Normalise line endings on commit so the working tree, the index and GitHub all
# agree. Without this, a file written by PowerShell (CRLF) hashes differently
# from the LF blob git stores, which makes a byte-level comparison against the
# remote look like a mismatch when the contents are identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.lua text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
